I've just finished writing this screensaver named "Galaxy God".<br><a href="http://www.galaxygod.pwp.blueyonder.co.uk/" class="postlink">http://www.galaxygod.pwp.blueyonder.co.uk/</a> <em class="text-italics">(download &amp; demo movie on page)</em><br><br>In a nutshell: <em class="text-italics">"Create smashing, orbiting galaxies from your own pictures"</em><br><br>It uses newtonian physics- (and home-made collision dynamics) the lighter each pixel of colour, the greater its mass, giving each picture its own unique system.  <strong class="text-strong">DX9 Required.</strong><br><br>Hope you enjoy it!<br><br>AK<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=627">Alpha Kudu</a> — Wed Jul 05, 2006 2:08 pm</p><hr />
